ime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Qn9DKRd1Dx9NehG3KtAcyJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52998, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Qn9DKRd1Dx9NehG3KtAcyJ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54526, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VTiAvbGPu3ws1kiwpGRmpb", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54826, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VTiAvbGPu3ws1kiwpGRmpb", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54826, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VTiAvbGPu3ws1kiwpGRmpb", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59223, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy, so it wasn't an option.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it completed everywhere.\n- checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. That avoided a second page to on-call.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback and the orchestrator error. It also lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LQoWWibjAyr8b8EJkjofa9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TbUrs2vvHH5UoZ3F8L8AaT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01BTxRNCve61EVazwvLTQcUe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01L45mFCBLgZE65P7Ukr7A1Z", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01F2ugueHKhguqyWGaBY486Q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014uQdcVoRMfCnftQPAztSxy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CuwjcwZHE7yh5Y1Nv1FmqV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Qn9DKRd1Dx9NehG3KtAcyJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release marked healthy. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left the regions on different versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry of the same rollback completed in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out. I'll check whether it was created before trying again, so I don't page on-call twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VTiAvbGPu3ws1kiwpGRmpb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy, so it wasn't an option.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, leaving the other two regions on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it completed everywhere.\n- checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. That avoided a second page to on-call.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback and the orchestrator error. It also lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}